1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,041
By the principle of superposition, the displacement at every point is the sum of the two.

2
00:00:06,041 --> 00:00:07,604
And look what the sum does.

3
00:00:07,604 --> 00:00:09,179
It does not travel at all.

4
00:00:09,179 --> 00:00:11,731
It just swells and shrinks in place.

